Hello,

I will start by sharing my code, my tests, and the errors I encounter.
If necessary, I will try to create a CodeSandbox project but it requires more setup.

This is a Next.js 16 project.
I use Prisma with SQL Server.
I started experiencing this issue when I upgraded my project to Prisma 7, so I thought this was the problem, but I didn't check that I had also upgraded Better Auth to 1.4.0.

After investigating, I found that the problem is with Better Auth > 1.4.0.

## Auth Configuration

Here is my auth configuration:

```typescript
