Although, it might be better if it was defined like:

```json
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "import": {
        "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
        "default": "./es/index.js"
      },
      "require": {
        "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
        "default": "./lib/index.js"
      }
    },
    "./*": {
      "import": {
        "types": "./lib/icons/*.d.ts",
        "default": "./es/icons/*.js"
      },
      "require": {
        "types": "./lib/icons/*.d.ts",
